{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-024", "question": "工单、批次、步骤编号都是1时，业务引用如何区分？", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "通过层级实体ID（work_order_id、batch_id、step_id）及各自独立的序列号字段（work_order_number、batch_number、step_number）进行区分。[业务14][业务18][业务25][业务17][业务19][业务26]\n具体而言，工单由源记录身份work_order_id=1标识，其原始编号为MES-WO-STARTED；批次由批次记录编号batch_id=1标识，批次序号为1；步骤由步骤记录编号step_id=1标识，步骤序号为1。[业务14][业务17][业务18][业务19][业务25][业务26]\nOpenMES来源分别包含工单、生产批次及工序步骤，各层级的*_id字段作为唯一身份标识，而*_number字段表示该层级内的序号，二者结合可明确区分不同层级的业务引用。[业务14][业务17][业务18][业务19][业务25][业务26]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [], "business_citations": [{"citation_id": "业务14", "source_system_id": "openmes-hc", "source_record_id": "1", "work_order_id": "1", "plant_code": "HC-P01", "source_revision": "mes-e9f616c0e2fe9b67394d83f8d8caa8be70442998ba1179ffddf54f6a8eb9", "payload_sha256": "34a3a7107a53e397f785516be6d1eeaa15191441308dc10c3334982731ab5c7b", "field_name": "source_record_id", "value": "1", "actual_start_precision": null, "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T10:36:07.758329+00:00", "last_verified_at": "2026-11-13T10:36:13.092288+00:00", "source_entity": "Work Order", "batch_id": "1", "step_id": "1"}, {"citation_id": "业务18", "source_system_id": "openmes-hc", "source_record_id": "1", "work_order_id": "1", "plant_code": "HC-P01", "source_revision": "mes-e9f616c0e2fe9b67394d83f8d8caa8be70442998ba1179ffddf54f6a8eb9", "payload_sha256": "34a3a7107a53e397f785516be6d1eeaa15191441308dc10c3334982731ab5c7b", "field_name": "batch_id", "value": "1", "actual_start_precision": "datetime", "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T10:36:07.758329+00:00", "last_verified_at": "2026-11-13T10:36:13.092288+00:00", "source_entity": "Batch", "batch_id": "1", "step_id": "1"}, {"citation_id": "业务25", "source_system_id": "openmes-hc", "source_record_id": "1", "work_order_id": "1", "plant_code": "HC-P01", "source_revision": "mes-e9f616c0e2fe9b67394d83f8d8caa8be70442998ba1179ffddf54f6a8eb9", "payload_sha256": "34a3a7107a53e397f785516be6d